 Crypto Transaction Analysis

This analysis evaluates transaction volume, category concentration,
and high-value exposure to support operational and risk monitoring.


  PART 5 — YOUR FIRST CRYPTO DASHBOARD (LOGIC, NOT TOOL)

Your dashboard should answer 3 questions:

Q1: Where does the value come from?

→ Revenue / volume by category

Q2: How concentrated is risk?

→ High-value transaction share

Q3: Are there trends?

→ (Later with time data)

  # Total volume
df["Amount"].sum()

# Volume by category
df.groupby("Category")["Amount"].sum()

# High-value transactions
high_value = df[df["Amount"] >= 200]

# Share of high-value volume
high_value["Amount"].sum() / df["Amount"].sum()
Even in Excel or Python, this logic is what matters.
